{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師原名妙德，先習賢首宗乘，乃京都懷師之嗣，後謁金山天濤\n雲師，得授磬山心印，因避香林叔諱，故別稱曰元峯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師八歲雖依父習儒，敏慧達文，\n絕無染世之見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師每\n日恒究宗泐金剛斷疑文一卷為事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華嚴為主，餘經為伴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九祖聖號，凡諷誦講演者，必要拈香禮敬，冥祈護念，成就自行四辨智。其為師者，\n方不謬佛意。祈　高賢者，一一奉行，故稽首云爾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即金剛二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即轉識成智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即斷障證真到彼岸故耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑\n從前無住行施、無相見佛兩叚經意而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生空\n見也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即法空也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又遣除無相見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從前第一疑中，不可以身相得見如來意\n而來，分二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初章又二：初、約疑處為問，二、順理實\n答。今"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上無為法不可取說而來，分二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初又四：初、破我見證預流，二、斷\n二果障，三、斷三果惑，四、斷四果惑盡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑亦從第三疑中不可取不可說而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑亦從第三疑中不可取而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑亦從第三疑中不取而來，分二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初又二：初、正校\n顯勝，二、別顯經勝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初、彰漏福至勝，二、特顯法勝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上四科，總顯法勝。離相得益，超佛果地。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初、由信得益，次、\n得益所以。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信解、受持，不以為難"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上捨身布施而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上文為利生行施而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從前不住相而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從前諸文無我而來，分二：初、重詰細\n由"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上實無有法發菩提心者而來。文\n二：初、反問徵詰，二、尊者領悟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斯反文也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即順文也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上佛在然燈佛前，因無法得而來。\n分三：初、斷無佛法疑，二、直示法體，三、喻示超法體。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此還從十二疑中實無有法發心者而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從不見生土可淨可度意而來。文二：\n初、五眼明淨，二、心徹智淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上心住顛倒而來。文二：初問答標\n多，次反覆申明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從前如來者，即諸法如義而來。文二：\n初、斷色身是佛疑，二、斷諸相是佛疑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上身相不可得見而來。文二：初、遮\n異見，二、示正見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上十二、十三疑中，無法得阿耨菩\n提而來。文二：初、詰探幽徹，二、佛示玄妙。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初、示無法得，二、示平等為正，三、示修成證果。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "示無\n法得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上修善法而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從第十九疑中是法平等而來。\n分三：初、示實無生度，二、示有度則墮四相，三、示佛假我非墮情見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從第十七疑如來不應以色身\n諸相而來，分三：初、詰探，二、佛難，三、佛遮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上不應以具足相觀佛而來。\n分四：初、遮毀相之念，二、出毀相之過，三、明福相不失，四、明不失所以"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上不受福德而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上應有去來，法無去來而來。\n分七：初、破應身異相，二、破法身一相，三、破一異合相，四、破凡夫墮我相見，五、示真我相，六、示正知見相，七、\n示寂用雙忘相。今初，應身異相，分二：初、問微塵多否，次、答微塵喻應無性。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即假觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "示空觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即中觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上塵喻化身是異而來，分二：\n初、明演法功德，次、明說法離染。今初，又二：初、示無住相施，二、較演法福勝所以。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此疑從上演法與不動而來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X25n0500_p0678c24"}
